id: jsonparse-cpp-1.00-ohos-libc-gcvt-missing-snprintf-float-string
error_signature: undefined symbol: gcvt|call to undeclared function 'gcvt'|implicit declaration of function 'gcvt'|implicit-function-declaration.*gcvt
match_keywords: gcvt, glibc legacy, musl, OHOS, undefined symbol, double to string, float string, __toFloatString, object_toString, snprintf, %.17g, libc missing, ANSI C, no build system
category: portability, libc, musl, gnu-extensions
severity: 2
trigger_tool: clang|ld.lld|conan
phase: link|compilation
keywords: gcvt, glibc-only, OHOS libc, double-to-string, snprintf replacement, portable format, ANSI C library
root_cause: gcvt() 是 glibc 遗留扩展函数（SVID/XPG，非 C 标准），musl/OHOS libc 不声明也不导出该符号。上游 jsonParse (liufeigit/jsonParse v1.00) 在 object.c 的 __toFloatString() 中用 gcvt(d, 30, str) 做 double→字符串，OHOS aarch64 下编译产生 implicit-function-declaration 警告、链接直接 undefined symbol: gcvt 失败。
rec_approach: replace-gcvt-with-portable-snprintf
rec_description: 用 C99 标准 snprintf 无条件替换 gcvt：snprintf(str, 30, "%.17g", d)。"%.17g" 是 double 往返保真（round-trip）的 C 标准最短可靠格式，任何 libc 通用，无需平台条件编译（符合 R8：补丁默认禁止 __OHOS__ 宏；本方案为纯可移植替换，无平台宏）。若上游 gcvt 依赖其 30 位有效数字语义，可用 "%.*g" 保留有效位需求，但 %.17g 已满足 IEEE-754 double 无损往返。
rec_commands: |
  diff --git a/object.c b/object.c
  --- a/object.c
  +++ b/object.c
  @@ __toFloatString(double d) {
   	char *str=NULL;
   
   	str=(char *)calloc(30, sizeof(char ));
  -	gcvt(d, 30, str);
  +	snprintf(str, 30, "%.17g", d);
   
   	return str;
   }
verification: jsonparse-cpp/1.00 ohos-aarch64: 静态库 clang -O2 -fPIC -c parse.c object.c 无警告；上游 testStr.c 编译运行 exit=0（status=1727204）；conan-verify G1-G4 PASS；test_package 消费者 round-trip 断言通过；W3 build_and_test.sh 1/1 通过。
related: archives/j/jsonparse-cpp/1.00/conanfile.py | archives/j/jsonparse-cpp/1.00/patches/0001-object.c.patch | knowledge/graph/E534.kv (gethostid/strverscmp/sigisemptyset/getusershell 同根因类) | knowledge/graph/E093.kv (getpass 同根因类)
last_updated: 2026-09-26
